            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Lina now speaks English, French and Spanish, and follows your Mac's language.</li>
<li>The CSV history export follows your language too, with the separator your spreadsheet expects.</li>
<li>Clearer error messages when a call or a transfer fails.</li>
<li>Links to the website and the license agreement in your language (Settings, About).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
